        <mxCell id="desc" value="Our container (navy box) on the left. At its right edge: two exit points — a REST arrow (blue, labelled &quot;REST / OpenAPI&quot;) and an event stream arrow (blue, labelled &quot;Events / AsyncAPI&quot;). On the right of those: a &quot;Site Systems&quot; box (gray). Slide background is blue." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#444444;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
